abstract: >-
  A compact research implementation for subject-disjoint 40-class SSVEP
  decoding with candidate-frequency evidence, time/frequency feature fusion,
  late attention, and train-to-deploy structural reparameterization.
keywords:
  - EEG
  - SSVEP
  - brain-computer interface
  - cross-subject decoding
  - structural reparameterization
